S101's research-pass prototype, 2026-11-01, never committed to src/: a forced-weight
sink for the threat kinds in stage two (S101_VARIANT, its bits 1 lesser 9, 2 hanging 5,
4 king-only 4, 8 push 4, 16 minor 2; 32 all rebuilt in stage one; 64 the pawn pairs in
stage one; S101_GATED; S101_TWICE) and a search census (S101_CENSUS), behind macros, over
the tree of 4d3edf6, whose src/ is b0338b5's. It includes threat_core.hpp, now
adocs/data/S101_threat_core.hpp. Its figures are in adocs/data/S101_census.txt, in
instructions and never a timing. It is not the shipped form and not the cost run's
patch, which is adocs/data/S101_cost_only.patch.

